_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-02-11T08:53:09Z","updated_at":"2019-02-11T08:53:09Z","body":"Just to clarify: The original code does **not** contain a POSTFIELDS !\r\n\r\n> if (rt == GET) {\r\n>                 if ((curlrc = curl_easy_setopt(easyhandle, CURLOPT_HTTPGET, 1)))\r\n>                         return httpRequestFailed(mp);\r\n>         } else {\r\n>                 log((\"%s\", logData ? logData : nonNullData));\r\n>                 if ((curlrc = curl_easy_setopt(easyhandle, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, nonNullData)))\r\n>                         return httpRequestFailed(mp);\r\n>         }\r\n\r\nThis code crashes on BSD.\r\n\r\n_renaudallard_ then inserted\r\n\r\n> if ((curlrc = curl_easy_setopt(easyhandle, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDSIZE, 0)))\r\n>                         return httpRequestFailed(mp);\r\n> \r\n\r\nto solve those crashes (https://sourceforge.net/p/esniper/bugs/767/)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/462254272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"VMbonn","id":47519627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTE5NjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47519627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn","html_url":"https://github.com/VMbonn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VMbonn/following{/other_user}","gists_u